@page "/services"
@inject IJSRuntime JS

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Capabilities</span>
        <h1 class="page-title reveal reveal-d1">What we do.</h1>
        <p class="page-sub reveal reveal-d2">
            We design, build, and modernize .NET, Blazor, and cloud systems for businesses that
            need software they can trust. No bloated teams, no vague handoffs - just focused
            engineering and direct accountability.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="services-list">
            <div class="service-row reveal">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">01</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">Blazor web development</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Modern web applications built with the power of C# and the flexibility of
                        Blazor - fast, interactive interfaces with reusable components and a
                        seamless full-stack .NET experience.</p>
                    <p>From internal dashboards to customer-facing platforms, we build applications
                        structured for performance, clarity, and long-term growth.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Blazor Server</span><span class="tag">Blazor WASM</span>
                        <span class="tag">Blazor Web App</span><span class="tag">Static SSR</span>
                        <span class="tag">Razor</span><span class="tag">C#</span>
                        <span class="tag">Prerendering</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row reveal reveal-d1">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">02</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">Azure cloud architecture</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Cloud systems built for reliability, scale, and cost control. We help
                        businesses design and deploy Azure-powered applications that are secure,
                        resilient, and ready for real-world usage.</p>
                    <p>Whether you need a lightweight web app, automated deployments, or
                        production-grade infrastructure, we build with performance and
                        maintainability in mind.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Azure Static Web Apps</span><span class="tag">Azure App Service</span>
                        <span class="tag">Azure Functions</span><span class="tag">Azure CDN</span>
                        <span class="tag">GitHub Actions</span><span class="tag">CI/CD</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row reveal reveal-d2">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">03</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">AWS cloud architecture</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Secure, scalable, high-availability infrastructure on AWS - supporting
                        modern web applications, backend systems, storage, databases, and global
                        content delivery.</p>
                    <p>From serverless workflows to production-ready hosting, we use AWS in a way
                        that's practical, cost-aware, and built for performance.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">S3</span><span class="tag">EC2</span><span class="tag">RDS</span>
                        <span class="tag">Route 53</span><span class="tag">ACM</span>
                        <span class="tag">CodePipeline</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row reveal">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">04</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">Legacy system migration</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Modernization without disruption. We help businesses move from outdated
                        desktop, web, or legacy .NET systems into modern Blazor and cloud-based
                        platforms.</p>
                    <p>The goal isn't just to replace old technology - it's to preserve what works,
                        improve what slows you down, and leave you with something easier to
                        maintain and scale.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">WPF to Blazor</span><span class="tag">React to Blazor</span>
                        <span class="tag">Angular to Blazor</span><span class="tag">Desktop to Web</span>
                        <span class="tag">Accessibility</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row reveal reveal-d1">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">05</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">Full-stack .NET API design</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Clean backend systems for serious business applications. We design secure,
                        maintainable APIs using ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework Core, SignalR, and
                        modern authentication standards.</p>
                    <p>Real-time communication, role-based access, integrations, and complex
                        business workflows - built structured, reliable, and easy to extend.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">ASP.NET Core</span><span class="tag">EF Core</span>
                        <span class="tag">Minimal APIs</span><span class="tag">SignalR</span>
                        <span class="tag">OAuth2</span><span class="tag">SQL Server</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row reveal reveal-d2">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">06</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">Performance &amp; SEO engineering</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Speed and visibility built into the foundation - strong Core Web Vitals,
                        search visibility, and smooth interaction across devices and networks.</p>
                    <p>From CDN delivery and caching to metadata and structured content, we make
                        your application feel faster and rank better.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Core Web Vitals</span><span class="tag">SEO</span>
                        <span class="tag">Lighthouse</span><span class="tag">CDN</span>
                        <span class="tag">Caching</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row reveal">
                <div class="sr-head">
                    <span class="sr-num">07</span>
                    <h3 class="display-3">Technical consulting</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="sr-body">
                    <p>Specialized engineering support for teams that need clarity and execution,
                        without the overhead of a large agency.</p>
                    <p>Architecture guidance, project delivery, technical troubleshooting, and
                        system reviews - clear communication at every step.</p>
                    <div class="sr-tags">
                        <span class="tag">Architecture Reviews</span><span class="tag">Agile Delivery</span>
                        <span class="tag">Hourly Consulting</span><span class="tag">Project Planning</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── TECH STACK ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section section-alt section-border-t">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2">
            <div class="reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow-kicker">Technology stack</span>
                <h2 class="display-2">The full stack.</h2>
                <p class="lead" style="margin-top:16px;">Every technology is chosen with intention.
                    No unnecessary complexity, no trend-chasing - just proven tools that support
                    reliable, maintainable software.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="reveal reveal-d1 stack-groups">
                <div class="stack-group">
                    <div class="sg-label">Frontend</div>
                    <div class="sg-tags"><span class="tag">Blazor WASM</span><span class="tag">Blazor Server</span><span class="tag">Razor</span><span class="tag">HTML/CSS</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stack-group">
                    <div class="sg-label">Backend</div>
                    <div class="sg-tags"><span class="tag">ASP.NET Core</span><span class="tag">EF Core</span><span class="tag">REST APIs</span><span class="tag">SignalR</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stack-group">
                    <div class="sg-label">Cloud</div>
                    <div class="sg-tags"><span class="tag">Azure Static Web Apps</span><span class="tag">Azure Functions</span><span class="tag">AWS S3 / EC2</span><span class="tag">AWS Lambda</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stack-group">
                    <div class="sg-label">Auth &amp; security</div>
                    <div class="sg-tags"><span class="tag">OAuth2</span><span class="tag">OpenID Connect</span><span class="tag">Role-Based Access</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stack-group">
                    <div class="sg-label">Data</div>
                    <div class="sg-tags"><span class="tag">SQL Server</span><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="tag">MySQL</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
            <span class="eyebrow-kicker">Common questions</span>
            <h2 class="display-2">Before you reach out.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list reveal reveal-d1">
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Do you work with companies outside Kenya?</summary>
                <p>Yes - that's most of the work. Gilbert Specialists Tech is set up for
                    cross-border engagements, including W-8BEN processing and independent
                    contractor frameworks for US and European clients.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>What time zone do you work in?</summary>
                <p>Nairobi, UTC+3. In practice that overlaps comfortably with European mornings and
                    US afternoons, and async communication covers the rest.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How is a project scoped and priced?</summary>
                <p>Every engagement starts with a discovery phase that ends in a fixed scope and a
                    milestone plan, so you know what you're paying for before development begins.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Can you take over an existing codebase?</summary>
                <p>Often, yes. Legacy migration - from WPF, React, or older .NET - is one of our
                    core capabilities, and we always start with an honest audit before committing
                    to a plan.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How fast do you respond?</summary>
                <p>Within 24 hours, across all time zones. If you've messaged through the contact
                    page, you'll hear back directly from Gilbert.</p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt section-border-t services-cta">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-row">
            <h2 class="display-2 reveal">Ready to build something real?</h2>
            <div class="btn-row reveal reveal-d1">
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a project →</a>
                <a href="/work" class="btn btn-secondary">See our work</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@code {
    protected override async Task OnAfterRenderAsync(bool firstRender)
    {
        if (firstRender)
            await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("GSTApp.initReveal");
    }
}
